OL,3,GNEWSABurglar boarded marina boats while
OL,4,Aowners slept
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar who boarded two boats in a
OL,7,Fmarina and stole mobile phones while
OL,8,Ftheir owners slept in their cabins has
OL,9,Fbeen given a suspended sentence as a
OL,10,F"last chance" for rehabilitation.
OL,12,FDaniel Cowie, 35, climbed over a
OL,13,Fsecurity barrier to get on to the
OL,14,Fpontoons at Royal Quays Marina in North
OL,15,FShields in the early hours of 24 June,
OL,16,FNewcastle Crown Court said.
OL,18,FOne of the victims, a 72-year-old man,
OL,19,Fsaid the burglary made him realise how
OL,20,F"vulnerable" he was.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
