OL,3,GNEWSABurglar boarded marina boats while
OL,4,Aowners slept
OL,5,
OL,6,FCowie, whose "appalling" criminal
OL,7,Frecord included dozens of thefts,
OL,8,Fadmitted burglary and fraud. Recorder
OL,9,FChristopher Rose said the public would
OL,10,Fbe better served by Cowie tackling his
OL,11,Fdrug and drink addiction than immediate
OL,12,Fimprisonment.
